"Biscuit downloads official Electron 41.10.7 (113 MiB on Apple silicon or 119 MiB on Intel; extracted payload about 275 MiB and 303 MiB respectively). The ZIP and Electron executable are SHA-256 verified before use. Biscuit retains the complete official runtime payload and its LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html notices in a private folder. Nothing is installed globally; personal browser profiles, Codex, and shared runtimes are untouched. Electron's sandbox and OS protections remain enabled." = "Biscuit 會下載官方 Electron 41.10.7（Apple silicon 版為 113 MiB，Intel 版為 119 MiB；解壓後嘅內容分別約為 275 MiB 同 303 MiB）。使用前會驗證 ZIP 同 Electron 可執行檔嘅 SHA-256。Biscuit 會喺私人資料夾保留完整嘅官方執行環境內容，以及 LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html 聲明。唔會喺全域安裝任何嘢；個人瀏覽器設定檔、Codex 同共用執行環境都唔會受影響。Electron 嘅沙盒同 macOS 保護會繼續啟用。";
"Biscuit downloads the configured GitHub release, verifies its SHA-256 digest when published, bundle identity, version, universal architectures, macOS compatibility, and code signature, then keeps your current app as a rollback copy before replacing it. Your data and preferences stay in place. The app folder must be writable; Biscuit never requests administrator access." = "Biscuit 會下載已設定嘅 GitHub 版本；如有發布，會驗證其 SHA-256 摘要、套件識別碼、版本、通用架構、macOS 相容性同程式碼簽署，然後先保留目前嘅應用程式作為還原副本，再取代佢。你嘅資料同偏好設定會保留。應用程式資料夾必須可以寫入；Biscuit 絕唔會要求管理員權限。";
