"Connect downloads the official Electron 41.10.7 runtime only after confirmation and verifies the architecture-specific release ZIP and executable SHA-256 before use. The complete extracted release, including Electron.app and the ZIP-root LICENSE and LICENSES.chromium.html, stays private in Biscuit's data folder. ChatGPT Web uses a dedicated persistent Electron profile and the same named session partition; Biscuit never copies cookies or reads private history. Sign-in opens a visible Biscuit-owned ChatGPT window only after you choose Connect. The selected model remains the one shown in ChatGPT; Biscuit does not change or silently substitute it. Electron's Chromium sandbox and OS protections remain enabled. Disconnect is available only for a Biscuit-managed profile; an adopted existing session is preserved." = "連線只會喺你確認後下載官方 Electron 41.10.7 執行環境，並喺使用前驗證對應架構嘅發佈 ZIP 同執行檔 SHA-256。完整解壓嘅發佈內容，包括 Electron.app、ZIP 根目錄嘅 LICENSE 同 LICENSES.chromium.html，都會私密地保存在 Biscuit 嘅資料夾。ChatGPT Web 使用專用、持續保留嘅 Electron 個人設定檔，同埋名稱相同嘅工作階段分區；Biscuit 絕不會複製瀏覽器 Cookie 資料，亦唔會查看私人瀏覽記錄。只有喺你選擇「連線」後，先會喺由 Biscuit 擁有而且可見嘅 ChatGPT 視窗中開始登入。ChatGPT 顯示嘅模型會維持不變；Biscuit 唔會更改模型，亦唔會喺你唔知情下代換模型。Electron 嘅 Chromium 沙盒同作業系統保護功能會繼續啟用。只可中斷由 Biscuit 管理嘅個人設定檔；已採用嘅現有工作階段會保留。";
"Connect through Codex app-server" = "透過 Codex app-server 連線";
"Connect to load available models" = "連線以載入可用模型";
"Connect your ChatGPT account in Biscuit's dedicated browser before using this route. No other provider was used." = "使用呢個途徑前，請先喺 ChatGPT 嘅專用瀏覽器登入你嘅 Biscuit 帳戶。冇使用其他供應商。";
