"Translate and Explain send only text you explicitly submit. If image titles are enabled, local OCR text from images captured while enabled may be sent only to the selected, enabled ChatGPT or Claude route/model for titling; image bytes are never sent, there is no provider fallback, and existing images are not backfilled. Refresh checks the selected route and retrieves remaining usage only for native ChatGPT and Claude sessions. It never submits translation text; ChatGPT Web, Apple Translation, and Claude Code CLI usage are not queried. A cached native session does not verify provider connectivity." = "翻譯同解釋只會傳送你明確提交嘅文字。如果啟用圖片標題功能，啟用期間擷取圖片時喺本機產生嘅 OCR 文字，只會傳送到已選取並啟用嘅 ChatGPT 或 Claude 路徑／模型，用嚟產生標題；唔會傳送圖片資料，亦唔會轉用其他供應商，現有圖片亦唔會補做。重新整理會檢查已選取嘅路徑，並只會為原生 ChatGPT 同 Claude 工作階段讀取剩餘用量。重新整理唔會提交翻譯文字；唔會查詢 ChatGPT Web、Apple 翻譯 同 Claude Code CLI 嘅用量。快取嘅原生工作階段唔代表已確認供應商連線。";
