"Use browser PKCE sign-in for native Claude. OAuth tokens are stored only in biscuit's separate Keychain service. Biscuit never reads Claude Code credentials; remaining usage is retrieved only when you explicitly select Refresh." = "使用瀏覽器PKCE登入原生Claude。OAuth令牌只會儲存喺biscuit獨立嘅Keychain服務。Biscuit永遠唔會讀取Claude Code憑證；只有喺你明確選擇「重新整理」時，先會擷取剩餘用量。";
"Use language correction" = "使用語言修正";
"Uses Apple's Translation framework on macOS 15 or later. First use may ask macOS to download language models. Apple may collect usage metrics and language pair, but not text content. Translation only; no generated lessons." = "喺 macOS 15 或更新版本上使用 Apple 嘅翻譯架構。首次使用時，可能會要求 macOS 下載語言模型。Apple 可能會收集使用指標同語言配對，但唔會收集文字內容。只提供翻譯，唔會生成教材。";
"Uses Vision language correction to normalize recognized text." = "使用Vision語言修正功能，整理識別到嘅文字。";
"Uses a Biscuit-owned Claude OAuth session through the official Messages streaming endpoint. Sign in from Account Settings; tokens are stored in a separate Biscuit Keychain service. Biscuit never reads Claude Code credentials; native Claude remaining usage is queried only when you explicitly select Refresh in Provider Settings." = "透過官方OAuth串流端點，使用由Messages擁有嘅Biscuit Claude工作階段。請喺帳戶設定登入；令牌會儲存喺獨立嘅Biscuit Keychain服務。Biscuit永遠唔會讀取Claude Code憑證；只有喺你喺供應商設定明確選擇「重新整理」時，先會查詢原生Claude嘅剩餘用量。";
"Uses biscuit's own ChatGPT subscription session with the ChatGPT Codex Responses streaming endpoint. No CLI or API key is used; provider-side compatibility and account access may change." = "使用 biscuit 自己嘅 ChatGPT 訂閱工作階段，連接 ChatGPT Codex Responses 串流端點。唔會使用 CLI 或 API 金鑰；供應商端嘅相容性同帳戶存取可能會有變。";
"Uses the language macOS currently prefers for text recognition." = "使用macOS目前偏好嘅語言進行文字識別。";
